/**
 * The translated rising sign calculator page (es, pt, fr, it, ru). The
 * English page, src/pages/rising-sign/index.astro, is the reference layout:
 * the calculator first with an example result, why the birth time matters,
 * what the result shows, the twelve risings, where to go next, questions.
 * Each locale page passes its FAQ (it also feeds that page's JSON-LD); every
 * other word is in COPY below.
 *
 * The example, the day of rising signs and the rulers are the English page's
 * own build-time values (src/lib/rising-example.ts), so every language shows
 * the same computed chart. The one-line manner on each card and the example
 * reading come from the translated rising profiles
 * (src/content/learn-i18n/{locale}/rising/): the first answer of each
 * profile defines the ascendant, then gives the manner after a colon.
 * Russian has no translated profiles yet; its lines are the rising lines of
 * the Russian sign guides (src/data/ru-guides.ts), and its cards link the
 * English profiles with the English-only cue.
 */
